"What is Fargo Rating?" = "什么是 Fargo Rating？";
"Fargo is the standard handicap system for pool — like a golf handicap but for billiards. Ratings run from ~100 (complete beginner) to 850+ (world-class). It's computed from match results and updates over time. Pool Stats uses your Fargo as a baseline to track improvement on your Dashboard." = "Fargo 是台球领域的标准让分评分系统，类似高尔夫差点，但用于台球。评分大约从 100（完全新手）到 850+（世界级）。它根据比赛结果计算，并会随着时间更新。Pool Stats 会把你的 Fargo 作为基线，在仪表盘中追踪你的进步。";
