"L Drill" = "L 型训练";
"Run a close-spaced L of balls into the same corner pocket while controlling short stun, follow, and draw routes." = "把紧密排成 L 形的球连续打入同一个底袋，同时控制短距离定杆、跟杆和拉杆路线。";
"Line pattern drill" = "直线走位训练";
"Pocket balls from a loose table-length line while controlling speed and staying on the right side of the next shot." = "沿着台面上松散排开的长线连续进球，同时控制力度并保持在下一杆的正确一侧。";
"Stop-shot progressive" = "渐进式定杆训练";
"Pocket one straight-in object ball and make the cue ball stop on the object-ball contact spot from increasing distances." = "将一颗直线球打进，并在不断拉远距离的情况下让母球停在碰撞点。";
"Circle control" = "圆区控制";
"Pocket balls from a center circle while keeping the cue ball inside the circle and away from other object balls." = "从台面中央的圆区连续进球，同时让母球始终留在圆内并避开其他目标球。";
"1-10 control ladder" = "1-10 控制阶梯";
"Pocket numbered balls from alternating side rows while moving the cue ball to the opposite side for the next shot." = "从两侧交替排列的目标球中按顺序进球，并把母球送到另一侧为下一杆做准备。";
"Mini runout" = "小型清台";
"Start with ball in hand on a small open layout and try to clear it cleanly, then add balls as you improve." = "在一个小型开放球型中以手中球开局，尝试干净清台，水平提升后再逐步加球。";
"Cut-shot progressive" = "渐进式切球训练";
"Pocket one repeatable cut shot, then increase cue-ball distance or cut angle as your aim and stroke hold up." = "重复打一颗可复位的切球，并在准度与出杆稳定后逐步增加母球距离或切角。";
"Follow progressive" = "渐进式跟杆训练";
"Pocket a straight-in object ball and follow the cue ball forward into a called target zone." = "将一颗直线球打进，并用跟杆让母球前送到指定目标区。";
"Draw progressive" = "渐进式拉杆训练";
"Pocket a straight-in object ball and draw the cue ball back into a called target zone." = "将一颗直线球打进，并用拉杆让母球回到指定目标区。";
"Stun tangent-line drill" = "定杆切线训练";
"Pocket a cut shot with stun and send the cue ball along the natural tangent line into a called zone." = "用定杆打进一颗切球，并让母球沿自然切线进入指定区域。";
"Wagon-wheel position" = "车轮走位";
"A classic cue-ball direction drill: pocket one object ball while sending the cue ball to different spoke-like target zones." = "经典的母球走向训练：打进一颗目标球的同时，把母球送往不同的辐条式目标区域。";
"Target-pool position" = "目标区走位";
"Pocket the object ball and land the cue ball in a clearly marked target zone." = "打进目标球，并让母球停在清晰标出的目标区域内。";
"Rail-cut progressive" = "库边切球渐进训练";
"Pocket repeatable rail cuts while keeping the cue ball under control after contact." = "反复练习可复位的库边切球，并在碰撞后保持母球可控。";
"Spot-shot challenge" = "点位球挑战";
"A standard shot-making challenge: shoot repeated spot shots and track how many you pocket cleanly." = "经典准度挑战：反复打点位球，并记录你能干净打进多少颗。";
"Long straight-in" = "长距离直线球";
"Pocket long straight-in shots while keeping the cue ball on the shot line after contact." = "练习长距离直线球，并让母球在碰撞后仍保持在出杆线上。";
"Thin-cut ladder" = "薄切阶梯";
"Pocket progressively thinner cut shots while preserving a repeatable stroke and realistic pocket speed." = "在保持稳定出杆和合理入袋速度的同时，逐步练习更薄的切球。";
"Back-cut ladder" = "反切阶梯";
"Pocket back cuts while controlling the cue-ball route away from scratch lines and traffic." = "练习反切球，同时控制母球路线，避开白球线路和球堆干扰。";
"No-rail pattern" = "无碰库路线";
"Run an open layout while avoiding any cue-ball rail contact." = "在开放球型中完成清台，同时避免母球碰任何库边。";
"3-ball ghost" = "3 球幽灵";
"A simple ghost drill: scatter three balls, take ball in hand, and try to run out before the ghost gets the rack." = "简单的幽灵练习：散开三颗球，手中球开局，尝试在“幽灵”赢局前完成清台。";
"Mini 9-ball ghost" = "迷你 9 球幽灵";
"A small rotation ghost set: start with ball in hand and run the balls in order." = "小型轮转幽灵练习：以手中球开局，并按顺序完成清台。";
"8-ball pattern mini" = "迷你 8 球路线训练";
"A small 8-ball pattern drill for choosing a group, clearing problem balls, and saving a key ball for shape." = "小型 8 球路线训练，用于练习选组、处理问题球，并保留关键球做走位。";
"Preset pattern challenge" = "预设路线挑战";
"Use a small preset layout instead of a random scatter and solve it as cleanly as you can." = "使用一个预设的小球型而不是随机散球，并尽可能干净地完成它。";
"Break-layout runout" = "开球后球型清台";
"Practice runouts from open break-style layouts that get gradually more demanding." = "从类似开球后的开放球型开始练习清台，并逐步提高难度。";
"Equal Offense" = "Equal Offense";
"A classic scoring drill: spread balls, take ball in hand, and score how many you can legally pocket in a turn." = "经典计分练习：散开球堆、手中球开局，计算一杆中你能合法打进多少颗球。";
"Rotation ladder" = "轮转阶梯";
"Shoot balls in rotation order and log how many you can finish cleanly each attempt." = "按轮转顺序击球，并记录每次尝试中你能干净完成多少颗。";
"15-ball rotation" = "15 球轮转";
"A full-table rotation workout for planning, endurance, and precise cue-ball movement through many transitions." = "整台轮转训练，锻炼路线规划、耐力，以及多次过渡中的精确母球控制。";
"Open-table scoring" = "开放台面计分";
"Start with ball in hand on an open table and see how many balls you can run before the inning ends." = "在开放台面上以手中球开局，看看一杆结束前你最多能连进多少颗球。";
"One-rail kick ladder" = "一库解球阶梯";
"Contact the object ball by kicking one rail from progressively harder cue-ball positions; pocketing is optional unless called." = "从越来越难的母球位置通过一库解到目标球；除非特别指定，否则不要求进球。";
"Cross-side bank ladder" = "横翻中袋阶梯";
"A bank-shot ladder for learning speed, angle, and pocket adjustment on cross-side banks." = "用于练习横翻中袋时力度、角度和进袋修正的翻袋阶梯训练。";
"Hide-the-ball safety" = "藏球防守";
"Play a legal safety: contact the object ball and hide either the cue ball or object ball from a direct makeable shot." = "打出一次合法防守：先碰到目标球，再把母球或目标球藏到对手无法直接进球的位置。";
"Break control" = "开球控制";
"Break normally and evaluate cue-ball control, balls pocketed, scratch avoidance, and whether the rack opens cleanly." = "按正常方式开球，并评估母球控制、进球数、避免白球以及球型是否被有效打开。";
"Center-ball stroke" = "中杆出杆";
"Pocket straight shots with clean center-ball contact and no unintended side spin." = "用干净的中杆触球打直线球，避免任何无意的侧旋。";
"Sidespin ladder" = "侧旋阶梯";
"A controlled sidespin drill: use measured side only when needed and land the cue ball in a called zone." = "受控侧旋训练：仅在需要时使用适量侧旋，并把母球送入指定区域。";
"Carom touch drill" = "碰球手感训练";
"Carom the cue ball or first object ball into a called target ball; pocketing is optional unless you call it." = "让母球或第一颗目标球碰到指定目标球；除非你提前声明，否则不要求进球。";
"Jump escape basics" = "基础跳球解困";
"Jump safely over a blocker to make legal object-ball contact; pocketing is optional unless you call it." = "安全地跳过阻挡球并合法碰到目标球；除非提前声明，否则不要求进球。";
"T Drill" = "T 型训练";
"Run a T-shaped layout in numerical order without letting the cue ball or object balls disturb the remaining balls." = "按数字顺序清理一个 T 形球型，同时避免母球或目标球扰乱剩余球。";
"Down-the-rail drill" = "顺库训练";
"Run balls set along one long rail in order while using draw/follow and side spin to avoid the side-pocket scratch." = "按顺序清理沿长库排开的球，同时使用拉杆、跟杆和侧旋来避免中袋白球。";
"Spot rotation drill" = "点位轮转训练";
"A spot-drill variation: pocket diagonal shots in rotation order without missing or touching non-shot balls." = "点位球训练的变体：按轮转顺序打进对角球，并避免失误或碰到非目标球。";
"Inside-outside English" = "内外塞训练";
"Pocket balls in rotation from diagonal rail-side positions while alternating inside and outside English routes." = "从对角的贴库位置按轮转顺序进球，并交替使用内塞和外塞路线。";
"Side-pocket cut ladder" = "中袋切球阶梯";
"Practice thin side-pocket cuts where the cue ball travels down-table after contact instead of dying near the side pocket." = "练习薄切中袋，并让母球在碰撞后继续向下台移动，而不是停死在中袋附近。";
"Brainwashing no-rail" = "Brainwashing 无碰库";
"A no-rail pattern drill for stun, draw, and small cue-ball routes: clear the balls without the cue ball touching a cushion." = "无碰库路线训练，强调定杆、拉杆和小范围母球线路：在母球不碰库的前提下清完所有球。";
"Ghost-ball aiming" = "幽灵球瞄准";
"A fundamentals aiming drill: visualize the ghost-ball contact point, pocket the object ball, and reset the same shot." = "基础瞄准训练：想象幽灵球接触点，打进目标球，然后复位同一杆继续练习。";
"Vision-center alignment" = "视觉中心对准";
"An alignment drill inspired by vision-center work: shoot straight shots and watch whether the cue ball stays on line." = "受视觉中心训练启发的对准练习：击打直线球，并观察母球是否始终保持在线路上。";
"Up-and-down speed" = "往返速度控制";
"A cue-ball-only speed drill: lag up and down the table to finish in progressively smaller end zones." = "仅用母球的速度训练：让母球在台面两端往返，并停在逐渐缩小的终点区域内。";
"Cross-line speed" = "过线速度控制";
"A cue-ball-only speed drill: roll across a chosen line and stop in the called lane beyond it." = "仅用母球的速度训练：让母球滚过指定线，并停在其后的目标带内。";
"Clock-system spin" = "时钟系统旋转";
"Pocket a repeatable cut shot while calling the cue-tip clock position and cue-ball finish zone." = "重复打一颗可复位的切球，并提前报出杆头时钟点位和母球终点区域。";
"Gearing outside spin" = "齿轮式外塞";
"Pocket a cut shot with outside English to reduce throw while still sending the cue ball through a called route." = "使用外塞打进切球以减少抛球，同时仍让母球沿指定路线运行。";
"One-rail target pool" = "一库目标区";
"Pocket the object ball and send the cue ball one rail to a marked target zone." = "打进目标球，并让母球经过一库后停在标记好的目标区。";
"Two-rail target pool" = "两库目标区";
"A target-pool route drill: pocket the object ball and play the cue ball two rails into a finish zone." = "目标区路线训练：打进目标球，并让母球经两库进入终点区域。";
"Three-rail target pool" = "三库目标区";
"A higher-control target-pool drill: pocket the object ball and send the cue ball three rails to the called finish area." = "更高控制要求的目标区训练：打进目标球，并让母球走三库到达指定终点区域。";
