"Five-ball mini L. Ball in hand only for the first shot." = "5 球迷你 L 型。只有第一杆可以手中球。";
"Seven balls, about two inches apart. Any legal route is allowed." = "7 颗球，间距约两英寸。允许任何合法路线。";
"Nine balls. Run the L in order into the same corner pocket." = "9 颗球。按顺序把整个 L 型打进同一个底袋。";
"Eleven balls. No bumping other balls and no ball in hand after a miss." = "11 颗球。不得撞动其他球，失误后也不能再手中球。";
"Full L with all fifteen balls. Call the next three cue-ball routes before shooting." = "完整 15 球 L 型。每次出杆前要先报出接下来三杆的母球路线。";
"Build the L from the middle of one long rail toward a corner, then across the foot rail, with balls about two inches apart." = "从一条长库的中段开始，朝一个底角摆出 L 形，再沿底库延伸，球与球之间约两英寸。";
"Start with cue ball in hand near the first ball and pocket every ball into the same corner in numerical order." = "从第一颗球附近手中球开局，按数字顺序把每颗球都打进同一个底袋。";
"Success: clear the whole L without a miss, scratch, collision with a non-shot ball, or lost next-shot angle." = "成功标准：完整清掉整个 L 型，中间不能失误、白球、碰到非目标球，或失去下一杆角度。";
"Four balls from the line. Start with ball in hand and use any pocket." = "从直线中选 4 颗球。手中球开局，任何袋口都可以。";
"Six balls. Any order, but no contact with other object balls." = "6 颗球。顺序不限，但不能碰到其他目标球。";
"Eight balls. Run them in numerical order with ball in hand only at the start." = "8 颗球。只在开局时手中球，其后按数字顺序清台。";
"Ten balls in order. Avoid getting frozen on a rail or another ball." = "10 颗球按顺序清台。避免母球贴库或贴到其他球。";
"Twelve balls in order. Call the next position side before every shot." = "12 颗球按顺序清台。每一杆前都要先报下一杆要落在哪一侧。";
"Place the balls in a loose line down the table with enough room to cue cleanly." = "把球沿台面松散地排成一条线，并留出足够空间方便正常出杆。";
"Start with ball in hand and pocket the selected balls, using the required order for your difficulty level." = "以手中球开局，并按当前难度要求的顺序把所选球全部打进。";
"Success: clear all selected balls without contacting a non-shot ball or leaving yourself unable to continue." = "成功标准：清掉所有选定球，过程中不能碰到非目标球，也不能把自己打到无法继续。";
"Make three clean short stop shots from one-diamond distance." = "从一颗菱形距离完成 3 杆干净的短距离定杆。";
"Make five stops, moving the cue ball between one and two diamonds away." = "完成 5 次定杆，母球距离在一到两颗菱形之间变化。";
"Make seven stops, increasing distance after every clean make." = "完成 7 次定杆，每打进一次就增加距离。";
"Make nine stops up to side-pocket distance. Cue ball may drift less than one ball." = "完成 9 次定杆，最远到中袋距离。母球允许漂移不到一颗球的距离。";
"Make ten consecutive stops across multiple diamonds with no visible drift." = "连续完成 10 次多菱形距离定杆，母球不能出现可见偏移。";
"Place one object ball on a straight line to a pocket and align the cue ball directly behind it." = "把一颗目标球摆在通向袋口的直线上，并让母球正对其后方。";
"Pocket the object ball and strike so the cue ball stops on the object-ball contact spot." = "把目标球打进，并让母球停在与目标球接触的位置上。";
"Success: the object ball is pocketed and the cue ball has no visible follow, draw, side drift, or scratch." = "成功标准：目标球入袋，且母球没有可见的跟进、回拉、侧偏或白球。";
"Pocket four balls from a large circle. Cue ball must stay inside." = "从一个大圆区域里打进 4 颗球。母球必须始终留在圆内。";
"Pocket six balls. Any order, any pocket, no rails after contact." = "打进 6 颗球。顺序和袋口不限，但碰球后母球不能碰库。";
"Pocket eight balls. No cue-ball exit and no contact with non-shot balls." = "打进 8 颗球。母球不能出圈，也不能碰到非目标球。";
"Pocket ten balls from a medium circle. Call the next ball before shooting." = "从中等大小的圆区里打进 10 颗球。每次出杆前先报下一颗球。";
"Pocket twelve balls from a tight circle. Any cue-ball exit ends the attempt." = "从紧凑圆区里打进 12 颗球。母球一旦出圈，本次尝试立即结束。";
"Arrange the balls in a circle near the center of the table and start with cue ball in hand inside the circle." = "把球摆成一个靠近台面中央的圆圈，并在圆内手中球开局。";
"Pocket balls in any order and into any pocket while keeping the cue ball inside the circle." = "按任意顺序把球打进任意袋口，同时保持母球始终留在圆内。";
"Success: pocket all selected balls without a scratch, cue-ball escape, rail contact, or accidental contact with another object ball." = "成功标准：打进所有选定球，过程中不能白球、出圈、碰库或意外碰到其他目标球。";
"Three balls. Land anywhere behind the opposite row after each shot." = "3 颗球。每一杆后母球只要停在对侧球列后方即可。";
"Four balls. Alternate sides and keep a playable angle." = "4 颗球。两侧交替处理，并保持可打角度。";
"Five balls. Land behind the opposite row without bumping another ball." = "5 颗球。母球要落到对侧球列后方，且不能撞到其他球。";
"Seven balls. Use the designated corner pockets and call the cue-ball lane." = "7 颗球。必须使用指定底袋，并提前报母球通道。";
"Full 1-10 pattern. Any missed position or collision ends the attempt." = "完整 1 到 10 路线。任何走位失误或碰撞都会结束本次尝试。";
"Set odd balls in one side row and even balls in the opposite side row." = "把奇数球摆在一侧球列，把偶数球摆在对侧球列。";
"Pocket each next-numbered ball into the assigned corner and send the cue ball behind the opposite row for the next shot." = "把下一颗编号球打进指定底袋，并把母球送到对侧球列后方准备下一杆。";
"Success: complete the selected sequence without a missed pot, scratch, collision, or missed next-side position zone." = "成功标准：完成所选序列，中间不能失误、白球、碰撞或错过下一侧的走位区。";
"Three open balls. Ball in hand before the first shot." = "3 颗开放球。第一杆前可以手中球。";
"Four open balls. Ball in hand before the first shot." = "4 颗开放球。第一杆前可以手中球。";
"Five open balls. Choose the order before shooting." = "5 颗开放球。出杆前先决定顺序。";
"Six open balls. Call the final three-ball pattern first." = "6 颗开放球。先报最后三颗球的处理路线。";
"Seven open balls. One planned route and no extra ball in hand." = "7 颗开放球。必须有预先规划路线，且不能额外再手中球。";
"Scatter the selected number of balls into open, runnable positions with no clusters." = "把所选数量的球散开成开放、可连打的球型，不能出现球堆。";
"Take ball in hand for the first shot, choose the full pattern, and pocket every ball." = "第一杆手中球开局，规划完整路线，然后把每颗球全部打进。";
"Success: clear the layout without a miss, scratch, foul, or extra ball in hand." = "成功标准：干净清台，中间不能失误、白球、犯规，也不能额外再手中球。";
"Five medium cuts with ball in hand reset after every shot." = "5 杆中等切球，每一杆后都可复位手中球。";
"Seven cuts. Keep the same object ball and vary the cue-ball distance." = "7 杆切球。保持同一颗目标球，改变母球距离。";
"Ten cuts from alternating sides of the object ball." = "10 杆切球，从目标球两侧交替练习。";
"Twelve thinner cuts. No rail-first contact and no soft rolling cheats." = "12 杆更薄的切球。不能先碰库，也不能靠软推偷角度。";
"Fifteen cuts from both sides. Missed pot ends the set." = "15 杆双侧切球。一旦失误，本组结束。";
"Place one object ball near a corner-pocket line and set the cue ball for a repeatable cut angle." = "把一颗目标球摆在靠近底袋线路的位置，并设置一个可重复的切球角度。";
"Pocket the object ball, reset the shot, and alternate sides or distances as required by the level." = "打进目标球后复位球型，并按当前难度要求交替更换两侧或距离。";
"Success: the object ball is pocketed cleanly with a balanced finish and no rail-first or unintended contact." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，出杆收尾平衡，且不能先碰库或发生意外碰撞。";
"Three follow shots. Cue ball must roll forward at least one diamond." = "3 杆跟杆。母球至少要向前滚过一颗菱形。";
"Five follows to a broad forward target zone." = "5 杆跟杆，母球要进入一个较宽的前方目标区。";
"Seven follows. Increase distance after each clean result." = "7 杆跟杆。每次成功后增加距离。";
"Nine follows to a narrow target lane without side spin." = "9 杆跟杆，母球要进入狭窄目标带，且不能带侧旋。";
"Ten follows at varying speeds. Cue ball must finish in the called zone." = "10 杆不同力度的跟杆。母球必须停在指定区域内。";
"Set a straight-in shot and mark a forward cue-ball target zone beyond the object ball." = "摆一杆直线球，并在目标球前方标出母球目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball with follow and send the cue ball forward into the called zone." = "用跟杆打进目标球，并把母球前送到指定区域。";
"Success: clean pot plus cue-ball finish in the forward target zone; wrong speed, scratch, or missed pot is a miss." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球停在前方目标区；力度错误、白球或失误都算失败。";
"Three short draw shots. Cue ball must come back at least half a diamond." = "3 杆短距离拉杆。母球至少要回拉半颗菱形。";
"Five draws from short distance into a broad target zone." = "5 杆短距离拉杆，母球要回到较宽的目标区。";
"Seven draws. Move the cue ball farther after each clean shot." = "7 杆拉杆。每次成功后把母球摆得更远。";
"Nine draws. Cue ball must return to a called one-diamond zone." = "9 杆拉杆。母球必须回到指定的一颗菱形目标区。";
"Ten draws across multiple distances with no miscues or rail contact." = "10 杆不同距离的拉杆，不能失准，也不能碰库。";
"Set a straight-in shot with the object ball on a pocket line and a draw target behind the cue ball." = "摆一杆直线球，让目标球在进袋线上，并在母球后方设置回拉目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball and draw the cue ball back into the called target zone." = "打进目标球，并把母球拉回到指定目标区。";
"Success: clean pot plus controlled draw into the target; miscue, scratch, missed pot, or wrong distance is a miss." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球受控地回到目标区；失准、白球、失误或距离不对都算失败。";
"Four stun shots to a wide tangent-line target." = "4 杆定杆，把母球送到较宽的切线目标区。";
"Six stun shots. Cue ball must cross the called side of the target." = "6 杆定杆。母球必须穿过目标区指定的一侧。";
"Eight stun shots to alternating target zones." = "8 杆定杆，交替打向不同目标区。";
"Ten stun shots. No forward roll or draw outside the target lane." = "10 杆定杆。母球不能出现明显跟进或回拉而偏离目标带。";
"Twelve stun shots at varied angles with a narrow target lane." = "12 杆不同角度的定杆，目标带较窄。";
"Set a cut shot and place a target zone on the natural tangent-line path." = "摆一颗切球，并在自然切线路径上设置目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball with a stun stroke so the cue ball travels along the tangent line." = "用定杆打进目标球，让母球沿着切线方向运行。";
"Success: clean pot plus cue-ball path crossing or landing in the called tangent-line zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球路径穿过或停在指定切线目标区。";
"Four wide target zones around the table." = "台面四周设置 4 个较宽的目标区。";
"Six targets. Use any natural follow, stun, or draw route." = "6 个目标。可以使用自然的跟杆、定杆或拉杆路线。";
"Eight targets. Call the cue-ball route before shooting." = "8 个目标。每次出杆前先报母球路线。";
"Ten targets. Avoid side spin unless the route requires it." = "10 个目标。除非路线确实需要，否则不要使用侧旋。";
"Twelve targets. Land within one ball width of each called zone." = "12 个目标。母球必须停在距离每个指定目标区一颗球宽以内。";
"Keep one object ball in the same pocketable position and choose a different cue-ball target for each rep." = "保持同一颗目标球处在可进球的位置，每次练习选择不同的母球目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball and use follow, stun, or draw to send the cue ball to the called spoke target." = "打进目标球，并用跟杆、定杆或拉杆把母球送到指定的辐条目标区。";
"Success: clean pot plus cue-ball finish in the called target area without a scratch or extra-ball contact." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球停在指定目标区，过程中不能白球或碰到其他球。";
"Four shots to a large target zone." = "4 杆打向一个较大的目标区。";
"Six shots. Cue ball must finish inside a hand-span target." = "6 杆。母球必须停在一个手掌大小的目标区内。";
"Eight shots to alternating target zones." = "8 杆，交替打向不同目标区。";
"Ten shots. Target is about one-diamond wide." = "10 杆。目标区大约是一颗菱形宽。";
"Twelve shots. Target is about one ball-width plus margin." = "12 杆。目标区大约是一颗球宽外加少量余量。";
"Place a paper target, coin, or chalk outline where you want the cue ball to finish." = "在你希望母球停下的位置放置纸片、硬币或粉笔画出的目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball and play position to the target." = "打进目标球，并把母球走位到目标区。";
"Success: clean pot plus cue-ball finish inside the target zone; missed pot, scratch, or missed zone fails the rep." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球停在目标区内；失误、白球或未进目标区都算失败。";
"Four easy rail cuts from short distance." = "4 杆短距离、较容易的库边切球。";
"Six rail cuts. Cue ball must stay off the rail after contact." = "6 杆库边切球。碰球后母球不能贴库。";
"Eight rail cuts alternating left and right sides." = "8 杆库边切球，左右两侧交替练习。";
"Ten thin rail cuts with a called cue-ball finish side." = "10 杆薄库边切球，并提前报母球最终停在哪一侧。";
"Twelve rail cuts from distance. Missed pot ends the set." = "12 杆远距离库边切球。一旦失误，本组结束。";
"Place the object ball a few inches off the long rail and choose the called corner pocket." = "把目标球摆在离长库几英寸的位置，并指定要进的底袋。";
"Pocket the rail cut, reset the shot, and alternate cue-ball side or distance as required." = "打进库边切球后复位球型，并按要求交替改变母球侧别或距离。";
"Success: cleanly pocket the rail ball and leave a playable cue-ball finish." = "成功标准：库边球干净入袋，并让母球留下可继续处理的走位。";
"Five spot shots with cue ball in hand behind the head string." = "从开球线后方手中球完成 5 杆点位球。";
"Seven spot shots. Use the same cue-ball starting area." = "7 杆点位球。母球起始区保持一致。";
"Ten spot shots. Alternate left and right cue-ball positions." = "10 杆点位球。母球左右位置交替。";
"Twelve spot shots from a fixed cue-ball position." = "12 杆点位球。母球位置固定不变。";
"Fifteen spot shots. Track streaks and misses." = "15 杆点位球，并记录连进和失误情况。";
"Place the object ball on the foot spot and put the cue ball behind the head string." = "把目标球放在置球点上，并把母球放在开球线后方。";
"Shoot the spot shot into the called corner pocket, resetting after every shot." = "把点位球打进指定底袋，每打完一杆都重新摆回。";
"Success: the object ball is pocketed cleanly; missed pot, scratch, or wrong pocket is a miss." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋；失误、白球或进错袋都算失败。";
"Four medium-distance straight shots." = "4 杆中距离直线球。";
"Six straight shots from half-table distance." = "6 杆半台距离直线球。";
"Eight long straight shots. Cue ball should stop or follow straight." = "8 杆长距离直线球。母球应直线停住或直线跟进。";
"Ten long shots. No side drift after contact." = "10 杆长球。碰球后母球不能出现侧偏。";
"Twelve full-table shots. Any unintended side spin counts as a miss." = "12 杆全台长球。任何无意侧旋都算失败。";
"Set the cue ball, object ball, and pocket on one straight line." = "让母球、目标球和袋口处在同一条直线上。";
"Pocket the object ball with a smooth, centered stroke." = "用平顺且居中的出杆把目标球打进。";
"Success: clean pot with the cue ball stopping, following, or drawing straight on the shot line with no side drift." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球无论停住、跟进还是回拉，都必须沿出杆线直行，不能侧偏。";
"Four modest cuts; move thinner only after a make." = "4 杆中等切球；只有打进后才能继续加薄。";
"Six cuts with a slightly thinner angle each make." = "6 杆切球，每打进一次就把角度略微加薄。";
"Eight cuts, alternating left and right." = "8 杆切球，左右两侧交替。";
"Ten thin cuts; no rail-first contact unless called." = "10 杆薄切球；除非特别指定，否则不能先碰库。";
"Twelve thin cuts from distance. Miss resets the angle." = "12 杆远距离薄切球。一旦失误就把角度重置。";
"Start with a comfortable cut into a called pocket." = "从一个较舒服的切球角度开始，并指定要进的袋口。";
"Pocket the object ball, then move the cue ball to create a thinner cut after each clean make." = "把目标球打进后，每成功一次就移动母球，让下一杆变得更薄。";
"Success: clean pot at the called angle with realistic speed; missed pot, rail-first contact, or over-hit speed fails the rep." = "成功标准：以合理速度从指定角度把目标球干净打进；失误、先碰库或速度过大都算失败。";
"Four short back cuts with ball in hand reset." = "4 杆短距离反切，每杆后可手中球复位。";
"Six back cuts. Cue ball must avoid the scratch path." = "6 杆反切。母球必须避开白球线路。";
"Eight back cuts alternating sides." = "8 杆反切，左右两侧交替。";
"Ten back cuts with a called cue-ball path." = "10 杆反切，并提前报母球路线。";
"Twelve back cuts from distance. Missed route counts as a miss." = "12 杆远距离反切。路线不到位也算失败。";
"Place the object ball near a pocket line where the cue ball must cut it backward into the pocket." = "把目标球摆在靠近袋口线路的位置，让母球必须反切才能把它打进。";
"Pocket the back cut and send the cue ball on the planned route away from the scratch line." = "把反切球打进，并让母球沿计划路线离开白球线路。";
"Success: clean pot plus a cue-ball route that leaves a playable next shot." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球路线为下一杆留下可处理的机会。";
"Three open balls. Cue ball may not contact a rail." = "3 颗开放球。母球不能碰库。";
"Four balls. No cue-ball rail contact after the first shot." = "4 颗球。第一杆之后母球都不能碰库。";
"Five balls. No rail contact and no accidental object-ball contact." = "5 颗球。不能碰库，也不能意外碰到其他目标球。";
"Six balls. Call the full route before shooting." = "6 颗球。出杆前先报完整路线。";
"Seven balls. Any rail contact ends the attempt." = "7 颗球。任何碰库都会结束本次尝试。";
"Scatter a small open layout where every selected ball has a reasonable pocket." = "散开一个小型开放球型，保证每颗选定球都有合理的入袋机会。";
"Take ball in hand first and pocket the balls in your chosen order without sending the cue ball to a rail." = "先手中球开局，并按你选择的顺序把球全部打进，同时不能让母球碰库。";
"Success: clear all selected balls with no cue-ball rail contact, scratch, foul, or accidental object-ball contact." = "成功标准：清掉所有选定球，过程中母球不能碰库、不能白球、不能犯规，也不能意外碰到其他目标球。";
"Three open balls. Any order." = "3 颗开放球。顺序不限。";
"Four open balls. Any order." = "4 颗开放球。顺序不限。";
"Five open balls. Choose the order before shooting." = "5 颗开放球。出杆前先决定顺序。";
"Six open balls. No clusters and no second ball in hand." = "6 颗开放球。不能有球堆，也不能第二次手中球。";
"Seven open balls. Call the pattern before shooting." = "7 颗开放球。出杆前先报整套路线路。";
"Scatter the selected number of balls in open positions." = "把所选数量的球散开到开放位置。";
"Take ball in hand and pocket every ball in any order." = "手中球开局，并按任意顺序把每颗球全部打进。";
"Success: full runout before any miss, scratch, or foul; any failure gives the rack to the ghost." = "成功标准：在没有失误、白球或犯规之前完成整台清台；任何失败都算这一局输给幽灵。";
"Three-ball rotation from ball in hand." = "3 球轮转，手中球开局。";
"Four-ball rotation from ball in hand." = "4 球轮转，手中球开局。";
"Five-ball rotation. No extra ball in hand." = "5 球轮转。不能额外再手中球。";
"Seven-ball rotation. Call the next two routes." = "7 球轮转。提前报接下来两杆的路线。";
"Full nine-ball ghost. Any miss gives the rack to the ghost." = "完整 9 球幽灵。一旦失误，这一局就算输给幽灵。";
"Scatter the selected number of balls and identify the lowest-numbered ball." = "把所选数量的球散开，并先确认当前编号最小的球。";
"Take ball in hand and pocket the balls in numerical rotation order." = "手中球开局，并按数字轮转顺序把球依次打进。";
"Success: clear the set in order before any miss, scratch, foul, or illegal first contact." = "成功标准：在没有失误、白球、犯规或非法先碰的情况下按顺序完成整组清台。";
"Four balls from one group plus an easy 8-ball finish." = "同组 4 颗球外加一颗较容易的 8 号收尾。";
"Five balls. Choose a key ball for the 8 before shooting." = "5 颗球。出杆前先选好给 8 号做走位的关键球。";
"Six balls. Identify and solve the problem ball early." = "6 颗球。尽早识别并处理问题球。";
"Seven balls. Call the full pattern before the first shot." = "7 颗球。第一杆前先报完整路线。";
"Full group plus 8. No second ball in hand." = "整组球外加 8 号。不能第二次手中球。";
"Lay out one group of balls plus the 8 in open but realistic positions." = "把同组球和 8 号摆成开放但贴近实战的球型。";
"Choose a key ball for the 8, then pocket the group and finish by pocketing the 8." = "先选好 8 号的关键球，再清理这一组并最后打进 8 号。";
"Success: clear the group and pocket the 8 without losing key-ball shape, missing, scratching, or fouling." = "成功标准：清掉整组并打进 8 号，中间不能丢掉关键球走位、失误、白球或犯规。";
"Three-ball placement layouts." = "3 球预设摆位。";
"Four-ball placement layouts." = "4 球预设摆位。";
"Five-ball placement layouts with one required route." = "5 球预设摆位，并包含一条指定路线。";
"Six-ball layouts. Miss or foul ends the attempt." = "6 球摆位。失误或犯规都会结束本次尝试。";
"Seven-ball layouts with planned key-ball position." = "7 球摆位，并提前规划关键球位置。";
"Create a small preset layout rather than a random scatter." = "不要随机散球，而是创建一个小型预设球型。";
"Take ball in hand, call the full pattern, and pocket balls in that pattern." = "手中球开局，先报完整路线，再按该路线清球。";
"Score: count balls cleared before the first miss, scratch, foul, or pattern breakdown." = "计分方式：记录第一次失误、白球、犯规或路线崩掉前清掉了多少颗球。";
"Three-ball runout after a controlled spread." = "在可控散球后完成 3 球清台。";
"Four-ball runout. Ball in hand after the simulated break." = "4 球清台。模拟开球后可手中球。";
"Five-ball runout from an open break-like layout." = "从类似开球后的开放球型完成 5 球清台。";
"Seven-ball runout with one awkward transition." = "7 球清台，其中包含一个别扭的过渡点。";
"Nine-ball runout. Miss, scratch, or foul ends the rack." = "9 球清台。失误、白球或犯规都会结束这一局。";
"Create an open break-like layout with no frozen clusters." = "摆出一个类似开球后的开放球型，不能有贴死球堆。";
"Start from ball in hand or the cue-ball position after a controlled break and pocket the balls in the chosen game order." = "从手中球或可控开球后的母球位置开始，并按所选球种顺序完成清台。";
"Success: clear the selected layout without a miss, scratch, foul, or second ball in hand." = "成功标准：清掉所选球型，中间不能失误、白球、犯规，也不能第二次手中球。";
"Five-ball rack. Count balls made before the first miss." = "5 球一组。记录第一次失误前打进了多少颗。";
"Seven-ball rack. Start with ball in hand." = "7 球一组。手中球开局。";
"Ten-ball rack. Any miss ends the inning." = "10 球一组。任何失误都会结束这一杆。";
"Twelve-ball rack. Call pockets and avoid clusters." = "12 球一组。要报袋口，并尽量避开球堆。";
"Fifteen-ball rack. Score balls made before the first miss." = "15 球一组。记录第一次失误前打进了多少颗。";
"Spread the balls in open positions and start with ball in hand." = "把球散成开放位置，并以手中球开局。";
"Pocket any legal ball and continue until the inning ends." = "打进任何合法目标球，并持续连打直到这一杆结束。";
"Score: count legal balls pocketed before the first miss, scratch, foul, or illegal shot." = "计分方式：记录第一次失误、白球、犯规或非法击球前打进了多少颗合法目标球。";
"Five-ball rotation set." = "5 球轮转组。";
"Seven-ball rotation set." = "7 球轮转组。";
"Nine-ball rotation set." = "9 球轮转组。";
"Twelve-ball rotation set." = "12 球轮转组。";
"Fifteen-ball rotation set. Play balls in numerical order." = "15 球轮转组。按数字顺序击球。";
"Pocket the lowest-numbered ball first and continue in rotation order." = "始终先打编号最小的球，并按轮转顺序继续。";
"Score: count legal balls pocketed in order before the first miss, scratch, foul, or illegal first contact." = "计分方式：记录第一次失误、白球、犯规或非法先碰前，按顺序合法打进了多少颗球。";
"Six-ball rotation subset." = "6 球轮转子集。";
"Eight-ball rotation subset." = "8 球轮转子集。";
"Ten-ball rotation subset." = "10 球轮转子集。";
"Twelve-ball rotation subset." = "12 球轮转子集。";
"Full fifteen-ball rotation. Miss or foul ends the run." = "完整 15 球轮转。失误或犯规都会结束这一杆。";
"Scatter or rack the selected balls and start with ball in hand." = "把所选球散开或摆好，并以手中球开局。";
"Pocket balls in numerical rotation order." = "按数字轮转顺序把球依次打进。";
"Score: count legal balls pocketed before the first miss, scratch, foul, or illegal first contact." = "计分方式：记录第一次失误、白球、犯规或非法先碰前合法打进了多少颗球。";
"Five balls. Score balls made before a miss." = "5 颗球。记录失误前打进了多少颗。";
"Seven balls. Start with ball in hand." = "7 颗球。手中球开局。";
"Ten balls. Call pockets and track the run." = "10 颗球。要报袋口，并记录连打表现。";
"Twelve balls. Avoid unnecessary traffic and clusters." = "12 颗球。尽量避免不必要的球路拥堵和球堆。";
"Fifteen balls. Score the inning before the first miss." = "15 颗球。记录第一次失误前这一杆的成绩。";
"Spread the balls and take ball in hand." = "把球散开，并以手中球开局。";
"Pocket any legal ball and continue your run until the inning ends." = "打进任何合法目标球，并一直连打到这一杆结束为止。";
"Score: count balls pocketed before the first miss, scratch, foul, or illegal shot." = "计分方式：记录第一次失误、白球、犯规或非法击球前打进了多少颗球。";
"Three one-rail kicks to a large contact zone." = "3 次一库解球，目标接触区较大。";
"Five one-rail kicks. Object-ball contact is required." = "5 次一库解球。必须合法碰到目标球。";
"Seven kicks. Call the rail and object-ball contact side." = "7 次解球。提前报碰哪条库以及碰到目标球的哪一侧。";
"Nine kicks with smaller cue-ball windows." = "9 次解球，母球落点窗口更小。";
"Ten kicks. Contact plus called safety side is required." = "10 次解球。既要合法碰球，也要符合指定防守侧。";
"Place an object ball in a repeatable position and move the cue ball to create one-rail kick routes." = "把目标球摆在一个可重复的位置，再移动母球来形成一库解球路线。";
"Call the rail first, then kick one rail to contact the object ball; do not require a pot unless you call one." = "先报碰哪条库，再通过一库去碰目标球；除非提前声明，否则不要求进球。";
"Success: legal object-ball contact on the called side, plus any called safety or pocketing requirement for the level." = "成功标准：按要求从指定一侧合法碰到目标球，并满足当前难度所要求的防守或进球条件。";
"Three short cross-side banks." = "3 杆短距离横翻中袋。";
"Five banks from comfortable angles." = "5 杆较舒服角度的翻袋。";
"Seven banks. Alternate left and right cross-side routes." = "7 杆翻袋。左右横翻路线交替练习。";
"Nine banks from distance. Call speed and pocket." = "9 杆远距离翻袋。要提前报力度和袋口。";
"Ten banks with no second chances after a miss." = "10 杆翻袋。失误后不能补救。";
"Place the object ball near a side-pocket bank angle." = "把目标球摆在适合横翻中袋的角度上。";
"Bank the object ball cross-side into the called side pocket and reset after each shot." = "把目标球横翻进指定中袋，并在每一杆后复位球型。";
"Success: the banked object ball is pocketed cleanly in the called side pocket." = "成功标准：目标球干净地翻进指定中袋。";
"Three safeties to a broad hiding zone." = "3 次防守，目标藏球区较宽。";
"Five safeties. Cue ball must finish behind the blocker." = "5 次防守。母球必须停在障碍球后方。";
"Seven safeties. Object ball must also move to a safe distance." = "7 次防守。目标球也必须被送到安全距离。";
"Nine safeties with a narrow hiding lane." = "9 次防守，藏球通道更窄。";
"Ten safeties. Full-ball hide required after legal contact." = "10 次防守。合法碰球后必须做到完整藏球。";
"Place an object ball, cue ball, and blocker ball to create a realistic safety." = "摆放目标球、母球和障碍球，营造一个贴近实战的防守局面。";
"Make legal contact and send the cue ball or object ball behind the blocker or into the called safe zone." = "先合法碰球，再把母球或目标球送到障碍球后方，或送入指定安全区。";
"Success: the incoming player has no direct makeable shot; pocketing the object ball is not the goal unless specifically called." = "成功标准：上手者没有直接可进的球；除非特别指定，否则本练习目标不是进球。";
"Five controlled breaks. Keep cue ball on the table." = "5 次可控开球。母球必须留在台面上。";
"Seven breaks. Make legal contact and avoid scratches." = "7 次开球。要合法开球，并避免白球。";
"Ten breaks. Track pocketed balls and cue-ball center-table control." = "10 次开球。记录进球数和母球停在台面中部的控制情况。";
"Twelve breaks. Cue ball must finish in the middle half of the table." = "12 次开球。母球必须停在台面中间一半区域。";
"Fifteen breaks. Pocket a ball, avoid scratch, and leave an open starter." = "15 次开球。要有进球、不白球，并留下一个可起手的开放球型。";
"Rack normally for the game you are practicing." = "按你正在练习的球种正常摆球。";
"Break with cue-ball control as the first goal and power as the second goal." = "开球时先以母球控制为第一目标，力量为第二目标。";
"Success: legal break, no scratch, controlled cue-ball finish, and either a pocketed ball or a realistic opening shot." = "成功标准：合法开球、不白球、母球落点受控，并且要么有进球，要么留下一个现实可打的起手机会。";
"Five center-ball shots from short distance." = "5 杆短距离中杆击球。";
"Seven shots. Cue ball must stay on the shot line." = "7 杆。母球必须保持在线路上。";
"Ten shots. No visible left/right cue-ball drift." = "10 杆。母球不能出现可见左右偏移。";
"Twelve shots from longer distance." = "12 杆更长距离的练习。";
"Fifteen shots. Any unintended side spin resets the set." = "15 杆。任何无意侧旋都会让本组重来。";
"Set up a straight-in shot and aim with center cue-ball contact." = "摆一杆直线球，并用中杆击打作为瞄准基础。";
"Pocket the object ball with a center-ball stroke and watch the cue ball after contact." = "用中杆出杆把目标球打进，并观察碰球后的母球。";
"Success: clean pot with the cue ball staying on the shot line; left/right drift means alignment or stroke error." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球保持在出杆线上；若左右偏移，说明对准或出杆有问题。";
"Three shots with small outside spin to a large zone." = "3 杆小外塞，目标区较大。";
"Five shots alternating inside and outside spin." = "5 杆，内塞和外塞交替。";
"Seven shots. Call spin direction and target zone." = "7 杆。提前报旋转方向和目标区。";
"Nine shots with thinner cuts and smaller target zones." = "9 杆，切球更薄，目标区更小。";
"Ten shots. Land in the called zone despite spin throw and deflection." = "10 杆。即便有抛球和偏转，也必须停进指定区域。";
"Set a repeatable cut shot with a cue-ball target zone." = "摆一个可重复的切球，并设置母球目标区。";
"Call inside or outside spin, pocket the object ball, and send the cue ball to the target zone." = "提前报内塞或外塞，打进目标球，并把母球送进目标区。";
"Success: clean pot plus called spin effect and cue-ball finish inside the target zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且实现了指定旋转效果，同时母球停在目标区内。";
"Three short caroms to a large target ball." = "3 次短距离碰球，目标球容错较大。";
"Five caroms. Legal first-ball contact and target contact required." = "5 次碰球。必须合法先碰第一颗球，并最终碰到目标球。";
"Seven caroms. Call the target contact side." = "7 次碰球。提前报碰到目标球的哪一侧。";
"Nine caroms with smaller target windows." = "9 次碰球，目标窗口更小。";
"Ten caroms. Contact and final cue-ball control both count." = "10 次碰球。既看是否碰到，也看母球最终控制。";
"Place two object balls so the cue ball or first object ball can carom into the called target ball." = "摆放两颗目标球，使母球或第一颗目标球可以再碰到指定的目标球。";
"Call the first contact and target-ball contact before shooting; pocketing is optional only if you call it." = "出杆前先报第一碰点和目标球碰撞；除非你提前声明，否则不要求进球。";
"Success: the called carom contacts the target ball with controlled speed; missed contact or wrong first contact fails the rep." = "成功标准：按要求完成碰球，并用受控速度碰到目标球；若没碰到或先碰错球都算失败。";
"Three short jump contacts over a low obstacle gap." = "3 次短距离跳球，越过较低障碍。";
"Five jumps. Contact the object ball legally." = "5 次跳球。必须合法碰到目标球。";
"Seven jumps. Call the target side of the object ball." = "7 次跳球。提前报碰到目标球的哪一侧。";
"Nine jumps with smaller landing windows." = "9 次跳球，落点窗口更小。";
"Ten jumps. Legal contact plus safe cue-ball landing required." = "10 次跳球。既要合法碰球，也要让母球安全落下。";
"Use a legal jump cue and practice only on equipment where jumps are permitted." = "使用合法跳杆，并只在允许跳球的器材上练习。";
"Place a blocker between cue ball and object ball, then jump to make legal object-ball contact." = "在母球和目标球之间放置障碍球，然后跳过去合法碰到目标球。";
"Success: clear the blocker safely, make legal contact, and land the cue ball under control; pocketing is optional unless called." = "成功标准：安全越过障碍、合法碰球，并让母球受控落下；除非提前声明，否则不要求进球。";
"Five-ball mini T. Ball in hand for the first shot." = "5 球迷你 T 型。第一杆可以手中球。";
"Seven balls. Run in order without bumping another ball." = "7 颗球。按顺序清台，不能撞到其他球。";
"Nine-ball T. Call the next position side before each shot." = "9 球 T 型。每一杆前都要先报下一杆走位到哪一侧。";
"Eleven balls. No collisions and no cue ball frozen to a rail." = "11 颗球。不能碰撞，也不能让母球贴库。";
"Full T. Run in order with no ball in hand after the opening shot." = "完整 T 型。除了开局外不能再手中球，并按顺序清台。";
"Arrange the balls in a T shape, with the stem pointing toward the lower half of the table." = "把球摆成 T 形，让 T 的竖干朝向台面的下半区。";
"Start with ball in hand and pocket the balls in numerical order." = "手中球开局，并按数字顺序把球依次打进。";
"Success: clear the selected T without a miss, scratch, collision with a non-shot ball, or lost next-shot angle." = "成功标准：完成所选 T 型，中间不能失误、白球、碰到非目标球，或丢掉下一杆角度。";
"Four rail balls. Ball in hand on the first shot." = "4 颗贴库球。第一杆可以手中球。";
"Six balls. Run in order and avoid the side-pocket scratch path." = "6 颗球。按顺序清台，并避开中袋白球线路。";
"Eight balls. Use the same corner-pocket direction for the full set." = "8 颗球。整组都要朝同一个底袋方向处理。";
"Ten balls. Alternate draw/right and follow/left routes between attempts." = "10 颗球。不同尝试之间交替使用拉右和跟左路线。";
"Full rail. No scratches, no rail-frozen cue ball, and no second ball in hand." = "完整贴库组。不能白球，不能让母球贴库，也不能第二次手中球。";
"Place the balls in numerical order along one long rail with enough room to cue cleanly." = "把球按数字顺序摆在一条长库旁，并留出足够空间正常出杆。";
"Pocket them in order, using draw, follow, and side spin to keep the cue ball out of the side pocket." = "按顺序把球打进，并通过拉杆、跟杆和侧旋让母球远离中袋。";
"Success: clear the rail sequence without a missed pot, scratch, or position that leaves no realistic next shot." = "成功标准：完成整条贴库序列，中间不能失误、白球，也不能把自己打到没有现实下一杆可打。";
"Three diagonal shots with ball in hand to start." = "3 杆对角球，手中球开局。";
"Five balls in rotation order." = "5 颗球，按轮转顺序处理。";
"Seven balls. Do not contact any non-shot ball." = "7 颗球。不能碰到任何非目标球。";
"Nine balls. Avoid leaving the cue ball frozen to a rail." = "9 颗球。避免让母球贴库停住。";
"Ten balls. Run the full sequence with no extra ball in hand." = "10 颗球。完整清掉整组，且不能额外手中球。";
"Place the first object ball on or near the spot and set the cue ball diagonally from it." = "把第一颗目标球摆在置球点或其附近，并让母球与它形成对角位置。";
"Pocket into the diagonal corner and continue through the remaining balls in rotation order." = "把球打进对角底袋，并按轮转顺序继续处理剩余球。";
"Success: clear the selected sequence without a miss, scratch, or accidental contact with another object ball." = "成功标准：完成所选序列，中间不能失误、白球，也不能意外碰到其他目标球。";
"Three shots with a large cue-ball target lane." = "3 杆练习，母球目标带较宽。";
"Five shots alternating inside and outside English." = "5 杆练习，内塞与外塞交替。";
"Seven shots. Call the spin before each stroke." = "7 杆练习。每次出杆前先报旋转。";
"Nine shots with thinner cuts and a smaller target lane." = "9 杆练习，切球更薄，目标带更小。";
"Ten shots. Pocket the ball and land on the called side of the table." = "10 杆练习。既要打进目标球，也要把母球停在指定的台面一侧。";
"Set the balls on diagonal rail-side positions and begin with the cue ball in front of the first ball." = "把球摆在对角的库边位置，并让母球从第一颗球前方开始。";
"Pocket the sequence in order, alternating inside and outside English routes across the table." = "按顺序清球，并在台面上交替使用内塞和外塞路线。";
"Success: clean pot on each shot plus cue-ball finish in the called lane." = "成功标准：每颗球都干净入袋，且母球停在指定通道内。";
"Three comfortable side-pocket cuts." = "3 杆较舒服的中袋切球。";
"Five cuts. Cue ball must reach the lower half of the table." = "5 杆切球。母球必须到达台面下半区。";
"Seven thin cuts with a called down-table lane." = "7 杆薄切球，并提前报下台方向通道。";
"Nine cuts. Cue ball must reach the short rail or called zone." = "9 杆切球。母球必须到达短库或指定区域。";
"Ten cuts from distance. Pocket speed and position both count." = "10 杆远距离切球。既看入袋速度，也看走位。";
"Place the object ball for a side-pocket cut and put the cue ball far enough away that speed control matters." = "把目标球摆成中袋切球，并让母球距离足够远，使力度控制变得重要。";
"Pocket the object ball into the side pocket and send the cue ball down-table to the called lane." = "把目标球打进中袋，并让母球向下台走到指定通道。";
"Success: clean side-pocket pot plus cue-ball finish in the called down-table lane." = "成功标准：目标球干净打进中袋，且母球停在指定的下台通道内。";
"Lay out a small open pattern in the middle of the table." = "在台面中央摆出一个小型开放路线球型。";
"Pocket every selected ball without allowing the cue ball to touch a rail." = "把所有选定球全部打进，同时不允许母球碰库。";
"Success: clear the pattern with no cue-ball rail contact, scratch, foul, or accidental object-ball contact." = "成功标准：完成整套路线，过程中母球不能碰库、不能白球、不能犯规，也不能意外碰到其他目标球。";
"Five medium cuts with a large visualized contact point." = "5 杆中等切球，使用明显的想象接触点。";
"Seven cuts from two cue-ball positions." = "7 杆切球，从两个母球位置练习。";
"Ten cuts alternating left and right sides." = "10 杆切球，左右两侧交替。";
"Twelve thinner cuts. No steering after the final warmup stroke." = "12 杆更薄的切球。最后一次试挥后不能再修正方向。";
"Fifteen cuts from distance. Missed pot ends the set." = "15 杆远距离切球。一旦失误，本组结束。";
"Place one object ball on a repeatable cut-shot line to a corner pocket." = "把一颗目标球摆在通往底袋的可重复切球线路上。";
"Visualize the ghost-ball contact point, then pocket the object ball and reset the shot." = "先想象幽灵球接触点，再把目标球打进，并复位同一杆继续练习。";
"Success: clean pot in the called pocket with no steering or rushed stroke." = "成功标准：目标球干净打进指定袋口，且不能出现修杆或仓促出杆。";
"Five short straight shots." = "5 杆短距离直线球。";
"Seven straight shots from medium distance." = "7 杆中距离直线球。";
"Ten shots. Cue ball must stay on the center line after contact." = "10 杆。碰球后母球必须保持在中线上。";
"Twelve longer shots with no visible side drift." = "12 杆更长距离的球，不能有可见侧偏。";
"Fifteen full-table alignment checks. Any side spin resets the set." = "15 杆全台对准检查。任何侧旋都会让本组重来。";
"Set a straight-in shot with the cue ball, object ball, and pocket on one line." = "摆一杆直线球，让母球、目标球和袋口完全共线。";
"Use the same stance and head position each time, then pocket the object ball with center-ball contact." = "每次都使用同样的站姿和头位，再用中杆把目标球打进。";
"Success: clean pot with the cue ball staying on the shot line; side drift means the alignment check failed." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球保持在出杆线上；如果出现侧偏，说明对准检查失败。";
"Four lags to a broad end zone." = "4 次比杆到较宽的终点区。";
"Six lags. Cue ball must finish within two diamonds." = "6 次比杆。母球必须停在两颗菱形范围内。";
"Eight lags to alternating end zones." = "8 次比杆，终点区交替切换。";
"Ten lags. Target is one diamond deep." = "10 次比杆。目标区深度约为一颗菱形。";
"Twelve lags. Finish within a narrow rail-side strip without touching the pocket points." = "12 次比杆。母球必须停在狭窄的库边带内，且不能碰到袋口尖角。";
"Start with only the cue ball near one short rail; there is no object ball to pocket in this drill." = "从一端短库附近仅放置母球开始；这个练习里没有目标球需要打进。";
"Lag the cue ball to the far end zone, then alternate back to the opposite end zone on the next rep." = "先把母球比到远端目标区，再在下一次练习中改为比回另一端目标区。";
"Success: the cue ball comes to rest inside the called zone without overrun, underrun, pocket contact, or cushion-point contact." = "成功标准：母球停在指定区域内，不能过头、不到位、碰袋口或碰到袋口尖角。";
"Four attempts to cross a wide center line." = "4 次尝试，跨过较宽的中线。";
"Six attempts. Stop in the called half of the table." = "6 次尝试。母球必须停在指定半台内。";
"Eight attempts to alternating target lanes." = "8 次尝试，目标通道交替变化。";
"Ten attempts. Target lane is one diamond wide." = "10 次尝试。目标通道宽度约为一颗菱形。";
"Twelve attempts. Stop within a narrow lane after crossing the line." = "12 次尝试。跨线后必须停在狭窄通道内。";
"Start with only the cue ball and choose a cross-table line plus a target lane beyond it." = "只摆母球，并选择一条横跨台面的线，再在线后方设定目标通道。";
"Roll the cue ball across the line and stop it in the called lane." = "让母球滚过这条线，并停在指定通道内。";
"Success: the cue ball crosses the line and comes to rest inside the called lane; there is no object ball to pocket." = "成功标准：母球成功跨线并停在指定通道内；这个练习没有目标球需要打进。";
"Three reps using small 10 or 2 o'clock side." = "3 次练习，使用轻微的 10 点或 2 点侧旋。";
"Five reps alternating left and right side." = "5 次练习，左右侧旋交替。";
"Seven reps. Call the clock point and finish zone." = "7 次练习。提前报杆头时钟点位和终点区。";
"Nine reps with smaller finish zones." = "9 次练习，终点区更小。";
"Ten reps using multiple clock points with no miscues or over-spin." = "10 次练习，使用多个时钟点位，不能失准或旋转过量。";
"Call the cue-tip clock position, pocket the object ball, and send the cue ball to the matching finish zone." = "提前报杆头时钟点位，打进目标球，并让母球走到对应终点区。";
"Success: clean pot plus the called cue-ball spin effect and finish zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，且母球呈现指定旋转效果并停在指定终点区。";
"Three medium cuts with small outside spin." = "3 杆中等切球，配轻微外塞。";
"Five cuts. Pocket speed must stay controlled." = "5 杆切球。进袋速度必须保持可控。";
"Seven cuts alternating left and right outside English." = "7 杆切球，左右外塞交替。";
"Nine thinner cuts with a called cue-ball lane." = "9 杆更薄的切球，并提前报母球通道。";
"Ten cuts. Match outside spin without over-cutting or over-running shape." = "10 杆切球。使用外塞时不能切过头，也不能走位过头。";
"Set one cut shot that can be repeated from both sides." = "设置一颗可以从左右两侧重复练习的切球。";
"Use outside English to pocket the object ball while calling the cue-ball route." = "使用外塞打进目标球，并提前报母球路线。";
"Success: clean pot with reduced throw and a cue-ball finish on the called route; over-cutting or over-running fails the rep." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋、抛球被有效降低，且母球停在指定路线；切过头或走过头都算失败。";
"Three one-rail routes to a large target." = "3 条一库路线，目标区较大。";
"Five routes. Cue ball must contact exactly one rail." = "5 条路线。母球必须恰好碰一库。";
"Seven routes to alternating target zones." = "7 条路线，目标区交替变化。";
"Nine routes. Target is one diamond wide." = "9 条路线。目标区宽约一颗菱形。";
"Ten routes. Exact rail and final zone must both be called." = "10 条路线。必须同时提前报碰哪条库以及最终停在哪个区域。";
"Set a pocketable object ball and place a cue-ball target zone after a one-rail route." = "摆一颗可进袋的目标球，并在一库路线后设置母球目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball and send the cue ball exactly one rail to the target." = "把目标球打进，并让母球恰好走一库到目标区。";
"Success: clean pot, exactly one cue-ball rail, and final rest inside the called target zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，母球恰好碰一库，并最终停在指定目标区内。";
"Three two-rail routes to a broad target." = "3 条两库路线，目标区较宽。";
"Five routes. Call the first rail before shooting." = "5 条路线。出杆前先报第一库。";
"Seven routes. Cue ball must contact two rails before the zone." = "7 条路线。母球在进入目标区前必须先碰两库。";
"Nine routes with smaller targets and controlled spin." = "9 条路线，目标区更小，且要求旋转受控。";
"Ten routes. Wrong rail count or missed target fails the rep." = "10 条路线。碰库数不对或未进目标区都算失败。";
"Set a pocketable object ball and place a cue-ball target zone after a two-rail route." = "摆一颗可进袋的目标球，并在两库路线后设置母球目标区。";
"Pocket the object ball and send the cue ball through the called two-rail path." = "把目标球打进，并让母球沿指定两库路线运行。";
"Success: clean pot, correct two-rail path, and final rest inside the called target zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，母球走对两库路线，并最终停在指定目标区内。";
"Three attempts to a large three-rail target." = "3 次尝试，目标为较大的三库终点区。";
"Five attempts. Use natural angle when available." = "5 次尝试。能用自然角度时优先使用自然角度。";
"Seven attempts. Call the three-rail path." = "7 次尝试。提前报三库路线。";
"Nine attempts with a smaller target and no scratch path." = "9 次尝试，目标区更小，且路线中不能有白球线路。";
"Ten attempts. Exact rail path and final zone required." = "10 次尝试。必须走对精确库路，并停在指定终点区。";
"Choose a pocketable object ball where a three-rail cue-ball path is realistic." = "选择一颗既能进袋、又能让母球合理走三库路线的目标球。";
"Pocket the object ball and send the cue ball through the called three-rail route." = "把目标球打进，并让母球沿指定三库路线运行。";
"Success: clean pot, correct three-rail path, and final rest inside the called target zone." = "成功标准：目标球干净入袋，母球走对三库路线，并最终停在指定目标区内。";
